            <!-- ==================== SECTION 3: HOW GDN WORKS (DEEP DIVE) ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> How GDN Works: The Auction System</h3>
            
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-12">
                    <div class="card bg-light mb-4">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <pre class="bg-dark text-white p-3 rounded mb-0" style="font-family: monospace;">
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    GOOGLE DISPLAY NETWORK AUCTION FLOW                   │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                         │
│  1. User visits webpage with ad space                                   │
│         ↓                                                               │
│  2. Page sends ad request to Google                                    │
│         ↓                                                               │
│  3. Google analyzes:                                                    │
│     • Page content (keywords, topics)                                  │
│     • User data (location, device, browsing history, interests)        │
│     • Advertiser targeting (placements, audiences, keywords)           │
│         ↓                                                               │
│  4. Eligible advertisers enter auction                                  │
│         ↓                                                               │
│  5. Ad Rank calculated = bid × Quality Score                           │
│         ↓                                                               │
│  6. Winner's ad displayed                                               │
│         ↓                                                               │
│  7. Advertiser charged = (next highest bid / Ad Rank) + $0.01          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</pre>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="alert alert-info">
                <strong> Display Network Bidding vs Search Network:</strong>
                <ul class="mb-0 mt-2">
                    <li><strong>Search Ads:</strong> Target keywords with high intent → Higher CPC ($1-4) → Higher conversion rates (2-5%)</li>
                    <li><strong>Display Ads:</strong> Target audiences & placements → Lower CPC ($0.50-1.50) → Lower conversion rates (0.5-1.5%) but <strong>massive reach & brand lift</strong></li>
                    <li><strong>Hybrid Strategy:</strong> Use Search for capturing demand, Display for creating demand & remarketing</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

