                                <li> Include <strong>logo + business name</strong> for brand recognition</li>
                                <li> Use <strong>action-oriented CTAs</strong> (Shop Now, Learn More, Get Quote)</li>
                                <li> Animated GIFs (3-5 frames) outperform static images by 30%</li>
                                <li> Maintain visual consistency with landing page</li>
                                <li> Refresh creatives every 4-6 weeks to prevent ad fatigue</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card mb-3">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Targeting Best Practices</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li> Start with <strong>automatic placements</strong> for data collection</li>
                                <li> Use <strong>frequency caps</strong> (3-5 impressions per user/day)</li>
                                <li> Layer targeting: <strong>audience + keywords + topic</strong> for precision</li>
                                <li> Exclude placements with <strong>low CTR & high cost</strong> weekly</li>
                                <li> Create <strong>custom intent audiences</strong> from search keywords</li>
                                <li> Segment remarketing lists by recency & page visited</li>
                                <li> Use <strong>customer match</strong> for email list targeting</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card mb-3">
                        <div class="card-header bg-warning text-dark">Bidding & Budget Best Practices</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li> Start with <strong>Maximize clicks</strong> to gather conversion data</li>
                                <li> After 30 conversions switch to <strong>Target CPA</strong></li>
                                <li> Set <strong>daily budget</strong> = 10-20x target CPA</li>
                                <li> Use <strong>portfolio bid strategies</strong> for multiple campaigns</li>
                                <li> Implement <strong>view-through conversion window</strong> (7-30 days)</li>
                                <li> Lower bids for <strong>mobile app placements</strong> if low converting</li>
                                <li> Increase bids for <strong>high-value remarketing lists</strong></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card mb-3">
                        <div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">Optimization Best Practices</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li> Review <strong>placement reports weekly</strong>, exclude poor performers</li>
                                <li> Analyze <strong>audience performance</strong> & allocate budget to top segments</li>
                                <li> Test <strong>device bid adjustments</strong> (mobile often converts better)</li>
                                <li> Use <strong>ad scheduling</strong> to show ads during peak conversion hours</li>
                                <li> Implement <strong>geotargeting</strong> for local campaigns</li>
                                <li> Run <strong>A/B tests</strong> on creative, landing pages, and audiences</li>
                                <li> Monitor <strong>brand safety</strong> with placement reports & negative keywords</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 11: QUICK REFERENCE CHECKLIST ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Quick Start Checklist for GDN Campaigns</h3>
            
            <div class="card bg-light">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <h4>Before Launch:</h4>
                            <ul>
                                <li>□ Define clear campaign goal (awareness/traffic/conversions)</li>
                                <li>□ Set up conversion tracking (pixel or GA4 import)</li>
                                <li>□ Create remarketing lists (min 100 users for active targeting)</li>
                                <li>□ Prepare 5-10 image assets (1:1 & 1.91:1 ratios)</li>
                                <li>□ Write 3-5 headlines & 3-5 descriptions</li>
                                <li>□ Upload business logo (100x100 px minimum)</li>
                                <li>□ Build custom intent audiences from search data</li>
                                <li>□ Define location & language targeting</li>
                                <li>□ Set daily budget (minimum $10/day for learning)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <h4>After Launch (First 30 Days):</h4>
                            <ul>
                                <li>□ Review placement reports weekly, exclude poor sites</li>
                                <li>□ Add negative placements daily</li>
                                <li>□ Monitor CTR by creative, pause low performers</li>
                                <li>□ Check audience performance, shift budget</li>
                                <li>□ Analyze conversion paths & attribution</li>
                                <li>□ Test landing page variations for CVR lift</li>
                                <li>□ Implement frequency caps (3-5/day)</li>
                                <li>□ Schedule weekly optimization tasks</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="alert alert-primary mt-3">
                        <strong> Success Metrics to Track:</strong>
                        <ul class="mb-0">
                            <li><strong>Awareness:</strong> Impressions, reach, CPM, brand lift</li>
                            <li><strong>Traffic:</strong> CPC, CTR, bounce rate, pages/session</li>
                            <li><strong>Conversions:</strong> CPA, ROAS, conversion rate, view-through conversions</li>
                            <li><strong>Remarketing:</strong> Repeat purchase rate, cart recovery rate</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 12: COMMON MISTAKES TO AVOID ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> 10 Common GDN Mistakes & How to Fix Them</h3>
            
            <div class="table-responsive mb-4">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-striped">
                    <thead class="table-dark">
                        <tr>
                            <th>Mistake</th>
                            <th>Consequence</th>
                            <th>Fix</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Targeting too broad</td>
                            <td>Wasted spend, low CTR, irrelevant clicks</td>
                            <td>Layer multiple targeting methods (audience + keywords + topic)</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Using only managed placements</td>
                            <td>Missing high-performing automatic placements</td>
                            <td>Start with automatic, add top performers as managed</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No frequency caps</td>
                            <td>Ad fatigue, brand hatred, wasted impressions</td>
                            <td>Set cap at 3-5 impressions per user/day</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Ignoring placement reports</td>
                            <td>Spending on low-quality or fraudulent sites</td>
                            <td>Review & exclude poor placements weekly</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Static creatives only</td>
                            <td>Lower performance, missed optimization</td>
                            <td>Use responsive display ads + dynamic creatives</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No remarketing</td>
                            <td>Leaving money on the table (80% of traffic never converts)</td>
                            <td>Set up remarketing lists for all major pages</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Single audience targeting</td>
                            <td>Limited reach, missing potential customers</td>
                            <td>Test 3-4 audience types, allocate budget to best</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Not using view-through conversions</td>
                            <td>Underreporting display value</td>
                            <td>Enable view-through conversions in attribution settings</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 13: TOOLS & RESOURCES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Essential GDN Tools & Resources</h3>
            
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white"> Creative Tools</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Google Web Designer</strong> - Create HTML5 ads</li>
                                <li><strong>Canva</strong> - Design display ads (templates available)</li>
                                <li><strong>Adobe Creative Cloud</strong> - Professional designs</li>
                                <li><strong>Placement 3D Mockups</strong> - Visualize ad placements</li>
                                <li><strong>Bannerbear API</strong> - Automated ad generation</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white"> Analytics Tools</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> - Audience insights</li>
                                <li><strong>Google Ads Reports</strong> - Placement, audience, creative</li>
                                <li><strong>Looker Studio (Data Studio)</strong> - Custom dashboards</li>
                                <li><strong>Google Tag Manager</strong> - Track conversions</li>
                                <li><strong>Optmyzr</strong> - Automated optimization</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-warning text-dark"> Research Tools</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Google Ads Keyword Planner</strong> - Find audience keywords</li>
                                <li><strong>SEMrush</strong> - Competitor display analysis</li>
                                <li><strong>SimilarWeb</strong> - Find audience's visited sites</li>
                                <li><strong>Ahrefs</strong> - Backlink & content research</li>
                                <li><strong>SparkToro</strong> - Audience intelligence</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-danger text-white"> Brand Safety</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Google Ads Placement Exclusion</strong> - Block sites</li>
                                <li><strong>Negative Keywords</strong> - Exclude irrelevant content</li>
                                <li><strong>Brand Lists</strong> - Protect against competitor adjacency</li>
                                <li><strong>Third-party verification</strong> - DoubleVerify, IAS</li>
                                <li><strong>AdX transparency</strong> - View auction-level data</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 14: SUMMARY ==================== -->
            <div class="alert alert-info mt-4">
                <h3 class="fw-bold"> GDN Key Takeaways</h3>
                <ul class="mb-0">
                    <li><strong>Massive reach:</strong> 90% of internet users across 2M+ sites and apps</li>
                    <li><strong>Lower cost:</strong> CPC/CPM 50-80% cheaper than search ads</li>
                    <li><strong>Visual storytelling:</strong> Use images, video, responsive, interactive formats</li>
                    <li><strong>Precision targeting:</strong> Audiences, topics, placements, keywords, demographics</li>
                    <li><strong>Remarketing powerhouse:</strong> Re-engage past visitors with tailored creatives</li>
                    <li><strong>Brand builder:</strong> Creates awareness and demand for products/services</li>
                    <li><strong>Full-funnel strategy:</strong> Top (awareness) → Middle (consideration) → Bottom (conversion)</li>
                    <li><strong>Start smart:</strong> Responsive display ads + automatic placements + audience targeting</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="alert alert-success mt-3">
                <strong> Next Steps:</strong> Now that you understand GDN fundamentals, proceed to learn about:
                <ul class="mb-0 mt-2">
                    <li>🔹 <strong>Topic 10.2:</strong> Managing Display Placement & Exclusions</li>
                    <li>🔹 <strong>Topic 10.3:</strong> Remarketing & Audience Strategies</li>
                    <li>🔹 <strong>Topic 10.4:</strong> Display Campaign Optimization Techniques</li>
                    <li>🔹 <strong>Topic 10.5:</strong> Creative Best Practices & A/B Testing</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
