            <!-- ==================== SECTION 7: KEYWORD QUALITY SCORE IN DISPLAY ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Understanding Keyword Quality Score in Display</h3>

            <div class="alert alert-info mb-4">
                <strong>What is Quality Score?</strong> Google assigns a quality score to your keywords based on relevance, CTR, and landing page experience. Higher quality scores lead to lower costs and better ad positions.
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Quality Score Factors</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Expected CTR:</strong> How likely users are to click your ad</li>
                                <li><strong>Ad Relevance:</strong> How well ad matches keywords</li>
                                <li><strong>Landing Page Experience:</strong> Quality and relevance of destination</li>
                                <li><strong>Historical Performance:</strong> Past campaign performance</li>
                                <li><strong>Contextual Relevance:</strong> How well keywords match placements</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">How to Improve Quality Score</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li>Create highly relevant ad groups</li>
                                <li>Write compelling ad copy with keywords</li>
                                <li>Optimize landing page for relevance</li>
                                <li>Use negative keywords to improve CTR</li>
                                <li>Regularly test and refine keywords</li>
                                <li>Monitor and improve placement relevance</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-warning text-dark">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Impact of Quality Score</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="table-responsive">
                                <table class="table table-sm">
                                    <thead class="table-light">
                                        <tr>
                                            <th>Score</th>
                                            <th>Impact on CPC</th>
                                            <th>Impact on Position</th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>Excellent (8-10)</td>
                                            <td>Lowest</td>
                                            <td>Best</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>Good (5-7)</td>
                                            <td>Medium</td>
                                            <td>Good</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>Poor (1-4)</td>
                                            <td>Highest</td>
                                            <td>Worst</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                            </div>
                            <div class="alert alert-light small mt-2 mb-0">
                                <strong>Tip:</strong> Higher quality scores can reduce CPC by 50% or more.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 8: KEYWORD MANAGEMENT BEST PRACTICES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Keyword Management Best Practices</h3>

            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Optimal Keyword Structure</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5>Per Ad Group Recommendations</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>10-20 keywords per ad group</li>
                                <li>Group by theme or category</li>
                                <li>Include a mix of match types</li>
                                <li>Use 3-5 high-priority keywords</li>
                                <li>Add 10-15 supporting keywords</li>
                            </ul>
                            <div class="alert alert-light small mt-3 mb-0">
                                <strong>Example:</strong> An ad group for "organic coffee" could include: organic coffee beans (exact), best organic coffee (phrase), coffee beans (broad), sustainable coffee (broad).
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Ongoing Management Tasks</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5>Weekly Tasks</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Review placement reports</li>
                                <li>Check keyword performance metrics</li>
                                <li>Adjust bids on high-performing keywords</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Monthly Tasks</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Add new keyword opportunities</li>
                                <li>Pause underperforming keywords</li>
                                <li>Review and update negative keywords</li>
                                <li>Analyze competitor keyword strategies</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 9: TROUBLESHOOTING COMMON KEYWORD ISSUES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Troubleshooting Common Keyword Issues</h3>

            <div class="accordion mb-4" id="keywordIssuesAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="keywordIssue1">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#keywordIssueCollapse1">
                            Keywords Not Generating Impressions
                        </button>
                    </h4>
                    <div id="keywordIssueCollapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#keywordIssuesAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            <h5>Possible Causes:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Keywords are too specific or narrow</li>
                                <li>Bids are too low for the competition</li>
                                <li>Limited relevant content available</li>
                                <li>Budget constraints limiting impressions</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Solutions:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Add broader match types to keywords</li>
                                <li>Increase keyword bids</li>
                                <li>Add more related keywords</li>
                                <li>Review location and language targeting</li>
                                <li>Check for any policy violations</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="keywordIssue2">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#keywordIssueCollapse2">
                            High Cost with Low Conversions
                        </button>
                    </h4>
                    <div id="keywordIssueCollapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#keywordIssuesAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            <h5>Possible Causes:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Keywords too broad, attracting irrelevant traffic</li>
                                <li>Audience targeting misaligned with keywords</li>
                                <li>Landing page doesn't match expectations</li>
                                <li>Ad creative not compelling enough</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Solutions:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Add more specific phrase/exact match keywords</li>
                                <li>Layer audience targeting for better relevance</li>
                                <li>Improve landing page alignment with keywords</li>
                                <li>Test new ad creatives and messaging</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="keywordIssue3">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#keywordIssueCollapse3">
                            Irrelevant Placements
                        </button>
                    </h4>
                    <div id="keywordIssueCollapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#keywordIssuesAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            <h5>Possible Causes:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Broad match keywords too general</li>
                                <li>Insufficient negative keywords</li>
                                <li>Automatic targeting discovering irrelevant placements</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Solutions:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Add specific negative keywords</li>
                                <li>Switch to phrase or exact match types</li>
                                <li>Review placement reports and exclude poor performers</li>
                                <li>Add positive placement targeting to control where ads appear</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 10: SUPREME LEVEL - ADVANCED KEYWORD PSYCHOLOGY ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Supreme Level: Advanced Keyword Psychology</h3>

            <div class="alert alert-warning mb-4">
                <strong>For Advanced Practitioners:</strong> Understanding the psychology behind display keywords can transform your campaign performance.
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-dark text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">The Psychology of Content Context</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5>User Mindset by Content Type</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Educational Content:</strong> Users are in learning mode, open to new ideas</li>
                                <li><strong>Entertainment Content:</strong> Users are relaxed, receptive to branding</li>
                                <li><strong>News Content:</strong> Users are informed, looking for updates</li>
                                <li><strong>Review Content:</strong> Users are in decision-making mode</li>
                            </ul>
                            <div class="alert alert-light small mt-3 mb-0">
                                <strong>Strategic Application:</strong> Match your keyword strategy to the content type where your ads appear. Educational keywords for learning content, solution keywords for review content.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-dark text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Keyword Intent Mapping</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="table-responsive">
                                <table class="table table-sm">
                                    <thead class="table-light">
                                        <tr>
                                            <th>Keyword Type</th>
                                            <th>User Intent</th>
                                            <th>Psychological State</th>
                                            <th>Best Ads</th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>Exploratory</td>
                                            <td>Discovery</td>
                                            <td>Curious, open</td>
                                            <td>Brand awareness</td>
