                                        <tr>
                                            <td>Problem-based</td>
                                            <td>Solution seeking</td>
                                            <td>Frustrated, seeking</td>
                                            <td>Benefit-focused</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>Comparison</td>
                                            <td>Decision making</td>
                                            <td>Evaluating, cautious</td>
                                            <td>Comparative ads</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>Action-oriented</td>
                                            <td>Transaction</td>
                                            <td>Ready, motivated</td>
                                            <td>Urgency-based</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                            </div>
                            <div class="alert alert-info small mt-2 mb-0">
                                <strong>Pro Strategy:</strong> Create separate ad groups for each intent type and customize messaging accordingly.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 11: SUMMARY AND NEXT STEPS ==================== -->
            <div class="alert alert-success mt-4">
                <h3 class="fw-bold">How Keywords Work in Display Campaigns: Key Takeaways</h3>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <strong>Core Concepts:</strong>
                        <ul class="small mb-0">
                            <li>Keywords target content, not searches</li>
                            <li>Context matching drives ad placement</li>
                            <li>Match types work differently than search</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <strong>Best Practices:</strong>
                        <ul class="small mb-0">
