                         <div class="section" id="topic-8">
    <div class="card mb-4 border">
        <div class="card-header bg-white py-3">
            <h2 class="mb-0">8 Keyword Planner for Display Ads</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body p-4">
            <div class="alert alert-light border mb-4">
                <strong>Google Keyword Planner is a powerful tool for discovering display keywords.</strong> While primarily designed for search campaigns, it provides invaluable insights for display keyword research, including topic ideas, competition levels, and potential audience reach.
            </div>
            <p>Keyword Planner is often misunderstood as a tool exclusively for search campaigns. However, when used strategically, it becomes an essential resource for display keyword discovery. The key is understanding which data points are relevant for display and how to adapt the tool's output for display campaign success.</p>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 1: UNDERSTANDING KEYWORD PLANNER FOR DISPLAY ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Understanding Keyword Planner for Display</h3>
            <div class="alert alert-info mb-4">
                <strong>Key Insight:</strong> For display campaigns, Keyword Planner helps you understand the topics and themes your target audience engages with, not just what they search for.
            </div>
            <div class="card bg-light mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <pre class="bg-dark text-white p-3 rounded mb-0"><code class="language-bash">
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    KEYWORD PLANNER FOR DISPLAY WORKFLOW                 │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                         │
│  START WITH SEED KEYWORDS                                               │
│  └── Core product or service terms                                      │
│          ↓                                                              │
│  GENERATE KEYWORD IDEAS                                                 │
│  └── Get topic and keyword suggestions                                  │
│          ↓                                                              │
│  FILTER AND ANALYZE                                                     │
│  └── Review relevance and competition levels                            │
│          ↓                                                              │
│  IDENTIFY TOPIC CLUSTERS                                                │
│  └── Group keywords by theme and intent                                 │
│          ↓                                                              │
│  CREATE KEYWORD LISTS FOR DISPLAY                                       │
│  └── Organize into ad groups                                            │
│                                                                         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                    </code></pre>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 2: GETTING STARTED WITH KEYWORD PLANNER ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Getting Started with Keyword Planner</h3>
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Accessing Keyword Planner</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5>Step-by-Step Access</h5>
                            <ol>
                                <li>Log into your Google Ads account</li>
                                <li>Click on "Tools" in the top navigation</li>
                                <li>Select "Keyword Planner" under Planning</li>
                                <li>Choose between two options:
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>"Discover new keywords" - for generating ideas</li>
                                        <li>"Get search volume and forecasts" - for analyzing data</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                            <div class="alert alert-light small mt-3 mb-0">
                                <strong>Important:</strong> You need an active Google Ads account with billing setup to access all Keyword Planner features.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Setting Up for Display Research</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5>Configuration for Display</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Set location targeting to your target market</li>
                                <li>Choose language preferences</li>
                                <li>Select "Google Ads" as the network</li>
                                <li>Choose "Display" as the targeting type (if available)</li>
                                <li>Add negative keywords to filter out irrelevant terms</li>
                            </ul>
                            <div class="alert alert-warning small mt-3 mb-0">
                                <strong>Key Difference:</strong> For display, focus on keyword relevance and topic clustering rather than search volume alone.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 3: DISCOVERING KEYWORDS FOR DISPLAY ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Discovering Keywords for Display</h3>
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Starting with Seed Keywords</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5>What Are Seed Keywords</h5>
                            <p>Seed keywords are the foundation of your research. They should represent your core products, services, or industry topics.</p>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Examples of Seed Keywords</h5>
                            <div class="alert alert-light small">
                                <p><strong>For a Digital Marketing Agency:</strong> digital marketing, SEO services, social media marketing, PPC management</p>
                                <p><strong>For an E-commerce Store:</strong> running shoes, sports equipment, workout gear, athletic apparel</p>
                            </div>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Best Practices</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Start with 5-10 seed keywords</li>
                                <li>Include your core product categories</li>
                                <li>Add industry-specific terminology</li>
                                <li>Consider customer pain points</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Using URL-Based Discovery</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5>How It Works</h5>
                            <p>Enter your website URL or a competitor's URL to get keyword ideas based on the content of that site.</p>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Benefits</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Discovers keywords you might not think of</li>
                                <li>Reveals content themes and topics</li>
                                <li>Identifies competitor keyword strategies</li>
                                <li>Provides inspiration for content categories</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">How to Use</h5>
                            <ol>
                                <li>Select "Discover new keywords"</li>
                                <li>Click "Start with a website"</li>
                                <li>Enter your or competitor URL</li>
                                <li>Let Google analyze the site content</li>
                                <li>Review suggested keywords and topics</li>
