                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
                                    <h5 class="mb-0">Step 2: Review and Refine</h5>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card-body small">
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Remove irrelevant keywords</li>
                                        <li>Group keywords by theme</li>
                                        <li>Check for duplicates</li>
                                        <li>Add comments for each group</li>
                                        <li>Set initial bids for each group</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="card h-100">
                                <div class="card-header bg-warning text-dark">
                                    <h5 class="mb-0">Step 3: Upload to Campaign</h5>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card-body small">
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>In Google Ads, go to your display campaign</li>
                                        <li>Select "Keywords" in the left menu</li>
                                        <li>Click the "Add" button</li>
                                        <li>Choose "Upload from file"</li>
                                        <li>Select your prepared keyword file</li>
                                        <li>Review and confirm upload</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 8: TROUBLESHOOTING KEYWORD PLANNER ISSUES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Troubleshooting Keyword Planner Issues</h3>
            <div class="accordion mb-4" id="plannerTroubleshootingAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="plannerIssue1">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#plannerCollapse1">
                            Limited Keyword Suggestions
                        </button>
                    </h4>
                    <div id="plannerCollapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#plannerTroubleshootingAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            <h5>Possible Causes:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Seed keywords are too narrow</li>
                                <li>Location or language targeting is too restricted</li>
                                <li>Insufficient historical data in your account</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Solutions:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Use broader seed keywords to start</li>
                                <li>Expand location and language targeting</li>
                                <li>Use URL-based discovery for more suggestions</li>
                                <li>Consider using multiple seed keyword combinations</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="plannerIssue2">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#plannerCollapse2">
                            Irrelevant Keyword Suggestions
                        </button>
                    </h4>
                    <div id="plannerCollapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#plannerTroubleshootingAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            <h5>Possible Causes:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Seed keywords are too broad or ambiguous</li>
                                <li>Multiple meanings or contexts for your keywords</li>
                                <li>Lack of negative keywords in the research</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Solutions:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Add qualifying words to your seed keywords</li>
                                <li>Use negative keywords to filter results</li>
                                <li>Review and remove irrelevant suggestions manually</li>
                                <li>Start with more specific seed keywords</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="plannerIssue3">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#plannerCollapse3">
                            Data Doesn't Match Campaign Performance
                        </button>
                    </h4>
                    <div id="plannerCollapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#plannerTroubleshootingAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            <h5>Possible Causes:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Keyword Planner shows search data, not display data</li>
                                <li>Display campaign performance depends on many factors</li>
                                <li>Targeting and bidding differences between search and display</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Solutions:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Use Keyword Planner as a starting point, not as the only source</li>
                                <li>Test keywords in actual campaigns to validate performance</li>
                                <li>Monitor campaign metrics and adjust accordingly</li>
                                <li>Combine Keyword Planner data with other research methods</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 9: SUPREME LEVEL - ADVANCED KEYWORD PLANNER STRATEGIES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Supreme Level: Advanced Keyword Planner Strategies</h3>
            <div class="alert alert-warning mb-4">
                <strong>For Advanced Practitioners:</strong> These strategies will help you extract maximum value from Keyword Planner for your display campaigns.
            </div>
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-dark text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Competitor URL Analysis</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5>Strategic Approach</h5>
                            <ol>
                                <li>Identify 3-5 top competitors</li>
                                <li>Analyze each competitor's website URL</li>
                                <li>Extract keyword themes from each analysis</li>
                                <li>Identify unique and overlapping keywords</li>
                                <li>Find gaps in competitor keyword coverage</li>
                            </ol>
                            <div class="alert alert-light small mt-3 mb-0">
                                <strong>Insight:</strong> Competitor URL analysis often reveals keywords you wouldn't find through seed keyword research alone.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-dark text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Seasonal Keyword Analysis</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5>Identifying Seasonal Trends</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Use Keyword Planner's historical data</li>
                                <li>Analyze year-over-year keyword patterns</li>
                                <li>Identify seasonal spikes in keyword interest</li>
                                <li>Prepare seasonal keyword lists in advance</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Example Seasonal Keywords</h5>
                            <div class="table-responsive">
                                <table class="table table-sm">
                                    <thead class="table-light">
                                        <tr>
                                            <th>Season</th>
                                            <th>Keyword Themes</th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>Holiday</td>
                                            <td>gift ideas, holiday shopping, special offers</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>Summer</td>
                                            <td>summer fashion, vacation planning, outdoor activities</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>Back to School</td>
                                            <td>school supplies, education tools, learning resources</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                            </div>
                            <div class="alert alert-info small mt-2 mb-0">
                                <strong>Strategy:</strong> Create separate keyword lists for each season and schedule campaigns accordingly.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 10: KEYWORD PLANNER BEST PRACTICES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Keyword Planner Best Practices for Display</h3>
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Do's</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li>Start with a broad range of seed keywords</li>
                                <li>Use URL-based discovery for comprehensive research</li>
                                <li>Focus on topic relevance over search volume</li>
                                <li>Create multiple keyword lists for different ad groups</li>
                                <li>Regularly refresh keyword research (quarterly)</li>
                                <li>Combine Keyword Planner data with other research tools</li>
                                <li>Export and organize keywords before importing</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">
                            <h4 class="mb-0">Don'ts</h4>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li>Don't rely only on search volume data</li>
                                <li>Don't import keywords without reviewing relevance</li>
                                <li>Don't use Keyword Planner data as absolute truth</li>
                                <li>Don't ignore competition indicators</li>
                                <li>Don't create too many keywords per ad group</li>
                                <li>Don't forget to add negative keywords</li>
                                <li>Don't overlook long-tail keyword opportunities</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 11: QUICK REFERENCE GUIDE ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Quick Reference: Keyword Planner for Display</h3>
            <div class="table-responsive mb-4">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-hover">
                    <thead class="table-dark">
                        <tr>
                            <th>Feature</th>
                            <th>Search Use</th>
                            <th>Display Use</th>
                            <th>Key Insight</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Discover New Keywords</td>
                            <td>Find search terms</td>
                            <td>Find content topics</td>
                            <td>Focus on themes, not just terms</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Get Search Volume</td>
                            <td>Assess keyword popularity</td>
                            <td>Assess topic popularity</td>
                            <td>Volume indicates content demand</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Competition Level</td>
                            <td>Assess bidding difficulty</td>
                            <td>Assess content competition</td>
                            <td>High competition = valuable topic</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>URL-Based Discovery</td>
                            <td>Rarely used</td>
                            <td>Highly valuable</td>
                            <td>Reveals competitor strategy</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Historical Data</td>
                            <td>Seasonal trends</td>
                            <td>Content seasonality</td>
                            <td>Plan seasonal campaigns</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 12: SUMMARY AND NEXT STEPS ==================== -->
            <div class="alert alert-success mt-4">
                <h3 class="fw-bold">Keyword Planner for Display Ads: Key Takeaways</h3>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <strong>Core Functions:</strong>
                        <ul class="small mb-0">
                            <li>Keyword and topic discovery</li>
                            <li>Competition analysis</li>
                            <li>Trend identification</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <strong>Best Practices:</strong>
                        <ul class="small mb-0">
                            <li>Focus on relevance over volume</li>
                            <li>Use URL-based discovery</li>
                            <li>Create themed keyword lists</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <strong>Next Steps:</strong>
                        <ul class="small mb-0">
                            <li>Topic 9: Competitor Keyword Research</li>
                            <li>Topic 10: Negative Keywords</li>
                            <li>Topic 11: Responsive Display Ads</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="alert alert-primary mt-2">
                <strong>Continue Learning:</strong> Now that you understand Keyword Planner for display, proceed to:
                <ul class="mb-0 mt-2">
                    <li>Topic 9: Competitor Keyword Research for Display Ads</li>
                    <li>Topic 10: Negative Keywords for Display Campaigns</li>
                    <li>Topic 11: Responsive Display Ads & Creative Assets</li>
