                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            <h5>Possible Causes:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Excessive negative keywords</li>
                                <li>Overly broad match types</li>
                                <li>Incorrect negative keyword selection</li>
                            </ul>
                            <h5 class="mt-3">Solutions:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Review and remove unnecessary negatives</li>
                                <li>Use phrase/exact match for precision</li>
                                <li>Analyze reach impact of each negative</li>
                                <li>Test removing selective negatives</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
