                         <!-- ========== 4 RESPONSIVE DISPLAY ADS & CREATIVE ASSETS ========== -->
<div class="section" id="topic-11">
    <div class="card mb-4 border">
        <div class="card-header bg-white py-3">
            <h2 class="mb-0">11 Responsive Display Ads & Creative Assets </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body p-4">
            <!-- Main Introduction -->
            <div class="alert alert-light border mb-4">
                <strong> One set of assets, thousands of combinations.</strong> Responsive Display Ads (RDAs) are the default (and recommended) ad type for the GDN. They automatically adjust to fit any ad space, from small mobile banners to large desktop takeovers. Google's AI tests thousands of combinations to find the best-performing creative for each placement.
            </div>

            <p>Responsive Display Ads are Google's most advanced ad format for the Display Network. Instead of creating dozens of static banners in different sizes, you upload a collection of assets (images, logos, headlines, descriptions), and Google's machine learning algorithms automatically generate optimized ad combinations. This saves time, improves performance, and ensures your ads look great everywhere—from 160x600 skyscrapers to 970x250 billboards.</p>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 1: WHY RDA IS BETTER ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Why Responsive Display Ads Outperform Static Banners</h3>
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 text-center">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="display-4 text-primary"></div>
                            <h4>50% More Conversions</h4>
                            <p class="small">Advertisers who switch from static to responsive display ads see an average of 50% more conversions at a similar CPA.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 text-center">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="display-4 text-success"></div>
                            <h4>70% Less Time</h4>
                            <p class="small">No need to design multiple sizes. Upload once, and Google automatically creates ads for all native ad slots (over 40 different sizes).</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 text-center">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="display-4 text-warning"></div>
                            <h4>AI-Powered Testing</h4>
                            <p class="small">Google's machine learning tests thousands of headline and image combinations to find the winner for each placement and audience segment.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 2: COMPLETE ASSETS TABLE (ENHANCED) ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Complete Assets Requirement & Specifications</h3>
            <div class="table-responsive mb-4">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-hover">
                    <thead class="table-dark">
                        <tr>
                            <th>Asset Type</th>
                            <th>Aspect Ratio</th>
                            <th>Min Requirement</th>
                            <th>Recommended</th>
                            <th>Technical Specs</th>
                            <th>Example</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Short Headline</strong></td>
                            <td>N/A</td>
                            <td>3</td>
                            <td>5-7</td>
                            <td>Max 30 characters, no punctuation at end</td>
                            <td>"40% Off Today", "Free Shipping Worldwide"</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Long Headline</strong></td>
                            <td>N/A</td>
                            <td>1</td>
                            <td>2-3</td>
                            <td>Max 90 characters, more descriptive</td>
                            <td>"Buy the latest running shoes with free next-day delivery"</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Description</strong></td>
                            <td>N/A</td>
                            <td>2</td>
                            <td>4-5</td>
                            <td>Max 90 characters, include CTA</td>
                            <td>"Limited time offer – get an extra 20% off. Shop now!"</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="table-info">
                            <td><strong>Landscape Image</strong></td>
                            <td><strong>1.91:1</strong></td>
                            <td>1</td>
                            <td>3-5</td>
                            <td>1200×628px (recommended), min 600×314, max 5000×5000</td>
                            <td>Product in use, lifestyle shot, clear focal point</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="table-info">
                            <td><strong>Square Image</strong></td>
                            <td><strong>1:1</strong></td>
                            <td>1</td>
                            <td>3-5</td>
                            <td>1200×1200px (recommended), min 300×300, max 5000×5000</td>
                            <td>Product close-up, logo + product, clean background</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="table-success">
                            <td><strong>Widescreen Image (16:9)</strong></td>
                            <td><strong>16:9</strong></td>
                            <td>0 (optional)</td>
                            <td>1-2</td>
                            <td>1920×1080 or 1280×720, min 640×360</td>
                            <td>Hero images, YouTube thumbnails, TV-ready creatives</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="table-success">
                            <td><strong>Portrait Image</strong></td>
                            <td><strong>4:5</strong></td>
                            <td>0 (optional)</td>
                            <td>1-2</td>
                            <td>960×1200px (recommended), min 320×400</td>
                            <td>Mobile-first campaigns, Instagram-style visuals</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Logo</strong></td>
                            <td><strong>1:1</strong></td>
                            <td>Recommended</td>
                            <td>1</td>
                            <td>128×128px min, transparent background, max 1MB</td>
                            <td>Brand logo on white/transparent background</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Business Name</strong></td>
                            <td>N/A</td>
                            <td>Required</td>
                            <td>–</td>
                            <td>Max 25 characters, exact brand name</td>
                            <td>"Nike", "Amazon", "HubSpot"</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>Video (Optional)</strong></td>
                            <td>16:9 or 1:1</td>
                            <td>0</td>
                            <td>1</td>
                            <td>15-30 seconds, MP4, max 30MB, 30fps</td>
                            <td>Product demo, testimonial, brand story</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <div class="alert alert-primary mt-2">
                <strong> Himanshu's Pro Tip:</strong> While 16:9 and 4:5 images are supported, <strong>1.91:1 (1200x628)</strong> remains the most versatile aspect ratio because it fits into the highest number of ad placements. Always prioritize uploading 1.91:1 and 1:1 images first, then add 16:9 images as supplemental assets for video-related placements.
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 3: IMAGE QUALITY CHECKLIST ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Image Quality Checklist for Approval & Performance</h3>
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white"> DO's</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li> Use high-resolution images (1200x628+ for landscape, 1200x1200+ for square)</li>
                                <li> Show the product being used (lifestyle shots outperform studio photos)</li>
                                <li> Include a clear focal point (face, product, logo)</li>
                                <li> Use natural lighting and professional photography</li>
                                <li> Test multiple color schemes to see what converts</li>
                                <li> Keep file sizes under 5120KB (5MB) for fast loading</li>
                                <li> Use JPG for photos, PNG for logos/graphics, GIF for simple animations</li>
                                <li> Add subtle drop shadows or borders to make images pop</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-danger text-white"> DON'Ts</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li> Images with excessive text (Google may disapprove - keep under 20%)</li>
                                <li> Blurry, pixelated, or low-resolution images</li>
                                <li> Watermarks or brand logos from other companies</li>
                                <li> Borders, frames, or "click here" arrows</li>
                                <li> Mismatched aspect ratios (will be cropped awkwardly)</li>
                                <li> Busy backgrounds that distract from the product</li>
                                <li> Inappropriate or offensive content (automatic rejection)</li>
                                <li> Before/after photos that look unrealistic</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 4: TEXT OVERLAY RULES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Text Overlay Rules (Google's Approval Policy)</h3>
            <div class="card bg-light mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p><strong>Google's text overlay limits:</strong> Images with more than 20% text may be disapproved or limited. The text is calculated as a percentage of the total image area.</p>
                    <div class="row text-center mt-3">
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-white">
                                <div class="display-6 text-success">✓</div>
                                <strong>Under 20%</strong>
                                <p class="small text-muted">Approved, full serving</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-white">
                                <div class="display-6 text-warning"></div>
                                <strong>20-30%</strong>
                                <p class="small text-muted">Limited serving</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-white">
                                <div class="display-6 text-danger"></div>
                                <strong>30-50%</strong>
                                <p class="small text-muted">Rarely served</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-white">
                                <div class="display-6 text-danger">⛔</div>
                                <strong>50%+</strong>
                                <p class="small text-muted">Disapproved</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="alert alert-warning mt-3">
                        <strong> Pro Tip:</strong> Use Google's <a href="https://support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/7692050" target="_blank">Text Overlay Checker Tool</a> before uploading to see if your image meets the guidelines.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
