            <!-- ==================== SECTION 6: ASSET COMBINATIONS & TESTING ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> How Google Tests Your Assets</h3>
            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>When you upload multiple assets, Google's AI creates thousands of combinations. For example:</p>
                    
                    <pre class="bg-dark text-white p-3 rounded mb-3">
Input:  5 headlines + 4 descriptions + 3 landscape images + 3 square images + 1 logo
        = 5 × 4 × 6 (image variations) × 1 = 120+ possible combinations per placement!</pre>
                    
                    <p>Google then serves these combinations across different placements and audiences, learning which combinations work best for:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Specific websites</strong> (e.g., tech blogs vs fashion sites)</li>
                        <li><strong>Device types</strong> (mobile vs desktop vs tablet)</li>
                        <li><strong>Audience segments</strong> (new visitors vs returning customers)</li>
                        <li><strong>Ad slots</strong> (leaderboard vs skyscraper vs mobile banner)</li>
                    </ul>
                    
                    <div class="alert alert-info mt-3">
                        <strong> Optimization Tip:</strong> After 2-3 weeks, check the "Combinations" report in Google Ads (Ad level → "View asset details" → "Combinations" tab). Pause underperforming headlines/images and add new variations to keep improving.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 7: COMMON CREATIVE MISTAKES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> 10 Common Creative Mistakes That Kill Performance</h3>
            <div class="table-responsive mb-4">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-striped">
                    <thead class="table-dark">
                        <tr>
                            <th>Mistake</th>
                            <th>Why It Hurts Performance</th>
                            <th>How to Fix</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Using only 1 headline</td>
                            <td>No variation for Google to test, limited optimization</td>
                            <td>Add 5-7 headlines with different angles (price, quality, urgency, social proof)</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Same headline for short and long</td>
                            <td>Missed opportunity to provide more context</td>
                            <td>Use short for punchy benefits, long for explanatory details</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Generic descriptions ("Click here")</td>
                            <td>No value proposition, low CTR</td>
                            <td>Include benefits + CTA: "Save 20% today. Shop now!"</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Low-quality images (blurry, pixelated)</td>
                            <td>Poor brand perception, lower CTR</td>
                            <td>Use 1200x628 minimum, professional photography</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Too much text overlay</td>
                            <td>Google may disapprove or limit serving</td>
                            <td>Keep text under 20% of image area</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Watermarks or borders</td>
                            <td>Distracting, looks unprofessional</td>
                            <td>Remove watermarks, use clean images</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No logo uploaded</td>
                            <td>Lower brand recognition</td>
                            <td>Always upload a transparent background logo</td>
                        </tr>
                        </tr>
                            <td>Mismatched landing page</td>
                            <td>High bounce rate, low conversion</td>
                            <td>Ensure ad copy matches landing page offer</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No CTAs in descriptions</td>
                            <td>Users don't know what to do</td>
                            <td>End every description with action-oriented CTA</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Never refreshing creative</td>
                            <td>Ad fatigue, declining CTR over time</td>
                            <td>Refresh images/headlines every 4-6 weeks</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 8: CREATIVE REFRESH SCHEDULE ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Creative Refresh Schedule & Best Practices</h3>
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 text-center">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="display-4"></div>
                            <h4>Weeks 1-2</h4>
                            <p class="small">Data collection phase. Let Google test all combinations. Don't make changes unless something is broken.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 text-center">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="display-4">🔍</div>
                            <h4>Week 3</h4>
                            <p class="small">Review Combinations report. Pause bottom 20% of headlines and descriptions. Add 2-3 new variations.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 text-center">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="display-4"></div>
                            <h4>Week 6</h4>
                            <p class="small">Full creative refresh. Replace underperforming images (bottom 25%). Test new image styles and angles.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 text-center">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="display-4"></div>
                            <h4>Ongoing</h4>
                            <p class="small">Monitor CTR and conversion rate weekly. Set up automated rules to pause low-performing assets.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 9: ASPECT RATIO VISUAL GUIDE ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Aspect Ratio Visual Guide</h3>
            <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="text-center p-3 border rounded bg-light">
                        <div class="bg-primary text-white p-3 rounded mb-2" style="height: 80px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                            <strong>1.91:1</strong>
                        </div>
                        <strong>Landscape</strong>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">1200 x 628px<br>Most versatile</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="text-center p-3 border rounded bg-light">
                        <div class="bg-success text-white p-3 rounded mb-2" style="height: 80px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                            <strong>1:1</strong>
                        </div>
                        <strong>Square</strong>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">1200 x 1200px<br>Social media</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="text-center p-3 border rounded bg-light">
                        <div class="bg-info text-white p-3 rounded mb-2" style="height: 80px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                            <strong>16:9</strong>
                        </div>
                        <strong>Widescreen</strong>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">1920 x 1080px<br>YouTube/Video</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="text-center p-3 border rounded bg-light">
                        <div class="bg-warning text-dark p-3 rounded mb-2" style="height: 80px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                            <strong>4:5</strong>
                        </div>
                        <strong>Portrait</strong>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">960 x 1200px<br>Mobile stories</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 10: AD STRENGTH EXPLAINED ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Understanding Ad Strength Ratings</h3>
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card text-center border-danger">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <span class="badge bg-danger mb-2">Poor</span>
                            <h4>0-50%</h4>
                            <p class="small">Missing critical assets. Low performance expected.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card text-center border-warning">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark mb-2">Average</span>
                            <h4>50-70%</h4>
                            <p class="small">Minimum requirements met, but limited combinations.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card text-center border-info">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <span class="badge bg-info mb-2">Good</span>
                            <h4>70-85%</h4>
                            <p class="small">Good asset variety, solid performance expected.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card text-center border-success">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <span class="badge bg-success mb-2">Excellent</span>
                            <h4>85-100%</h4>
                            <p class="small">Maximum combinations. Best possible performance.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="alert alert-success mt-2">
                <strong> Himanshu's Goal:</strong> Always aim for "Excellent" ad strength. This means you have:
                <ul class="mb-0 mt-2">
                    <li>✓ 5+ short headlines</li>
                    <li>✓ 4-5 descriptions</li>
                    <li>✓ 5-15 images (both landscape and square)</li>
                    <li>✓ 1 logo (transparent background)</li>
                    <li>✓ Business name</li>
                    <li>✓ Final URL</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 11: TOOLS FOR CREATIVE ASSETS ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Best Free & Paid Tools for Creating Display Ads</h3>
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">🆓 Free Tools</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Canva</strong> - 1000+ display ad templates, drag-and-drop editor</li>
                                <li><strong>Google Web Designer</strong> - Create HTML5 animated ads</li>
                                <li><strong>Adobe Express</strong> - Quick social and display ad creation</li>
                                <li><strong>Unsplash / Pexels</strong> - Free high-quality stock images</li>
                                <li><strong>Remove.bg</strong> - Remove image backgrounds for logo extraction</li>
                                <li><strong>Bannerbear API</strong> - Automate ad creation with templates</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white"> Paid Tools (Professional)</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Adobe Creative Cloud</strong> - Photoshop, Illustrator, After Effects</li>
                                <li><strong>Figma</strong> - Collaborative design for teams</li>
                                <li><strong>Sketch</strong> - Mac-based design tool</li>
                                <li><strong>Bannerflow</strong> - Enterprise ad creation and management</li>
                                <li><strong>Creatopy</strong> - Bulk ad creation and resizing</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-info text-white"> AI-Powered Tools</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Midjourney / DALL-E</strong> - Generate unique background images</li>
                                <li><strong>Adobe Firefly</strong> - AI image generation and editing</li>
                                <li><strong>Leonardo.ai</strong> - Free AI image generation</li>
                                <li><strong>Copy.ai / Jasper</strong> - Generate headlines and descriptions</li>
                                <li><strong>Photoroom</strong> - AI background removal and product photos</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- ==================== SECTION 12: QUICK REFERENCE CHECKLIST ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Responsive Display Ad Launch Checklist</h3>
            <div class="card bg-light mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <strong> Copy Assets:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-2">
                                <li>□ 5+ short headlines (30 chars)</li>
                                <li>□ 2-3 long headlines (90 chars)</li>
                                <li>□ 4-5 descriptions (90 chars)</li>
                                <li>□ Business name (max 25 chars)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <strong> Visual Assets:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-2">
                                <li>□ 3-5 landscape images (1.91:1 / 1200x628)</li>
                                <li>□ 3-5 square images (1:1 / 1200x1200)</li>
                                <li>□ 1-2 logo variations (1:1, transparent)</li>
                                <li>□ Optional: 1-2 widescreen images (16:9)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <strong> Pre-Launch Checks:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-2">
                                <li>□ Final URL working and mobile-friendly</li>
                                <li>□ All images under 5MB, no watermarks</li>
                                <li>□ Text overlay under 20% of image area</li>
                                <li>□ Ad strength showing "Excellent"</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Summary Alert -->
            <div class="alert alert-success mt-3">
                <strong> Himanshu Shekhar's Summary for Section 10.4:</strong>
                <ul class="mb-0 mt-2">
                    <li> Responsive Display Ads are Google's recommended format - use them for all new campaigns!</li>
                    <li> Upload 5+ headlines, 4-5 descriptions, and 5-15 images for maximum optimization</li>
                    <li> 1.91:1 (1200x628) and 1:1 (1200x1200) are the most important aspect ratios</li>
                    <li> 16:9 (1920x1080) is optional but beneficial for YouTube placements</li>
                    <li> Keep text overlay under 20% of image area to avoid disapprovals</li>
                    <li> Refresh creative assets every 4-6 weeks to prevent ad fatigue</li>
                    <li> Monitor the "Combinations" report to identify winning asset combinations</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="alert alert-warning mt-2">
                <strong> Remember:</strong> Even the best targeting won't save poor creatives. Invest time in creating high-quality, relevant images and headlines. Test multiple variations, and let Google's AI find the winners!
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
