            <p>YouTube is owned by Google and integrates seamlessly with Google Ads. Video advertising on YouTube allows you to capture attention through sight, sound, and motion—making it one of the most engaging and memorable ad formats available. Unlike text or display ads, video ads can tell stories, demonstrate products, and evoke emotions that drive brand loyalty and conversions.</p>

