                                <li>Shorts ads have 20-40% lower CPVs than in-stream</li>
                            </ul>
                            
                            <h4 class="mt-3"> Shorts Ad Specs:</h4>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Aspect Ratio:</strong> 9:16 (vertical)</li>
                                <li><strong>Resolution:</strong> 1080x1920 recommended</li>
                                <li><strong>Length:</strong> Up to 60 seconds (15-30 seconds best)</li>
                                <li><strong>Skippable:</strong> Yes, after 5 seconds</li>
                                <li><strong>Sound:</strong> Optional (design for mute-first viewing)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-5">
