                                <strong> Shorts Ad Specs:</strong><br>
                                9:16 aspect ratio<br>
                                1080x1920 resolution<br>
                                60 seconds max<br>
                                Vertical orientation<br>
                                Skippable after 5 seconds
                            </div>
