            <!-- ==================== SECTION 12: VIDEO CREATION BEST PRACTICES (ADDED) ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Video Creation Best Practices for Higher Conversion</h3>
            
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white"> Script Structure (30-60 seconds)</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <strong>0-5 seconds: The Hook</strong>
                                <p class="small">Grab attention immediately. Use a question, bold statement, or visual hook.</p>
                                <code>"Tired of expensive software that doesn't work?"</code>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <strong>5-20 seconds: The Problem/Agitation</strong>
                                <p class="small">Explain the pain point your product solves. Show the "before" state.</p>
                                <code>"Most tools charge $100+ but still have bugs and no support."</code>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <strong>20-45 seconds: The Solution</strong>
                                <p class="small">Introduce your product as the answer. Show benefits, not just features.</p>
                                <code>"Meet Product X - built by experts, works flawlessly, and costs just $9/month."</code>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <strong>45-60 seconds: Social Proof + CTA</strong>
                                <p class="small">Show testimonials, stats, or awards. End with clear next step.</p>
                                <code>"Join 50,000+ happy customers. Start your free trial today!"</code>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white"> Production Quality Guidelines</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="table-responsive">
                            <table class="table table-sm">
                                <tr><th>Element</th><th>Best Practice</th></tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Lighting</td>
                                    <td>Use soft, diffused lighting. Avoid harsh shadows. 3-point lighting recommended</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Audio</td>
                                    <td>Invest in a decent microphone (Blue Yeti, Rode). Voice clarity is #1 priority</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Background</td>
                                    <td>Clean, uncluttered, or branded background. Avoid distractions behind the speaker</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Text overlay</td>
                                    <td>Large (min 24pt), high contrast, consistent font, support for mute viewers</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Length</td>
                                    <td>15-30 seconds for consideration, 30-60 seconds for explanation, 6 seconds for reminders</td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                            </div>
                            <div class="alert alert-info mt-3">
                                <strong> Mobile Optimization:</strong> Always preview on mobile! Most YouTube views are on phones. Text should be readable, faces visible, colors contrasted.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 13: COMMON YOUTUBE AD MISTAKES (ADDED) ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> 10 Common YouTube Advertising Mistakes & How to Fix Them</h3>
            
            <div class="table-responsive mb-4">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-striped">
                    <thead class="table-dark">
                        <tr>
                            <th>Mistake</th>
                            <th>Consequence</th>
                            <th>How to Fix</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No hook in first 5 seconds</td>
                            <td>80%+ skip rate, wasted ad spend</td>
                            <td>Start with question, bold statement, or visual hook in 0-5 sec</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No captions/subtitles</td>
                            <td>85% of mobile viewers without sound = no message delivery</td>
                            <td>Add YouTube captions or burned-in subtitles</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Targeting too broad</td>
                            <td>Low relevance, high CPV, poor CTR</td>
                            <td>Start with custom intent or in-market audiences</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No branding in first 3 seconds</td>
                            <td>Viewers don't know who you are, low brand recall</td>
                            <td>Show logo or name within first 3 seconds</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No clear CTA</td>
                            <td>Viewers watch but don't take action</td>
                            <td>End every ad with specific, actionable CTA</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Video too long without value</td>
                            <td>High skip rate, low view-through rate</td>
                            <td>Keep under 30 seconds for prospecting, deliver value quickly</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No A/B testing</td>
                            <td>Missed optimization opportunities</td>
                            <td>Test 2-3 different creatives simultaneously</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Ignoring remarketing</td>
                            <td>Leaving money on the table</td>
                            <td>Set up remarketing lists for all engagement levels</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Wrong bidding strategy</td>
                            <td>Overpaying or under-delivering</td>
                            <td>Start with CPV for awareness, Target CPA for conversions</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No frequency caps</td>
                            <td>Ad fatigue, negative brand sentiment</td>
                            <td>Set 3-5 impressions per user/week</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 14: YOUTUBE AD APPROVAL POLICIES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> YouTube Ad Approval Policies - What's Allowed?</h3>
            
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card border-success h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-success text-white"> Allowed Content</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li>Product demonstrations and features</li>
                                <li>Educational and informative content</li>
                                <li>Brand storytelling and testimonials</li>
                                <li>Limited-time offers and promotions</li>
                                <li>Entertainment and humor</li>
                                <li>Comparison content (fair, factual)</li>
                                <li>User-generated content reviews</li>
                                <li>Behind-the-scenes footage</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card border-danger h-100">
                        <div class="card-header bg-danger text-white"> Restricted/Disallowed</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <ul>
                                <li>Sexual or suggestive content</li>
                                <li>Violence or dangerous acts</li>
                                <li>Hate speech or harassment</li>
                                <li>Misleading claims or false advertising</li>
                                <li>Copyrighted music without license</li>
                                <li>Political content (requires verification)</li>
                                <li>Gambling or prohibited substances</li>
                                <li>Shock value content</li>
                                <li>Before/after images for health conditions</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 15: SUCCESS STORIES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Real-World YouTube Advertising Success Stories</h3>
            
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card">
                        <div class="card-header bg-dark text-white">Case Study 1: Dollar Shave Club</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p><strong>Challenge:</strong> Launch a new subscription razor brand with limited budget</p>
                            <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Created a humorous, viral-style video ad with a clear CTA</p>
                            <p><strong>Results:</strong>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>12,000+ orders in first 48 hours</li>
                                    <li>5+ million views in 3 months</li>
                                    <li>Company acquired for $1 billion</li>
                                </ul>
                            </p>
                            <div class="alert alert-light small"> ROI: 500x on ad spend</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card">
                        <div class="card-header bg-dark text-white">Case Study 2: Nike - Dream Crazy</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p><strong>Challenge:</strong> Build brand awareness for new campaign</p>
                            <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Emotional storytelling video featuring Colin Kaepernick</p>
                            <p><strong>Results:</strong>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>30+ million views in 2 weeks</li>
                                    <li>31% increase in online sales</li>
                                    <li>1.2 billion earned media impressions</li>
                                </ul>
                            </p>
                            <div class="alert alert-light small"> Brand lift: 15% increase in purchase intent</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card">
                        <div class="card-header bg-dark text-white">Case Study 3: Himanshu Shekhar's Course Launch</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p><strong>Challenge:</strong> Drive enrollments for digital marketing course</p>
                            <p><strong>Solution:</strong> 30-second skippable in-stream ad + discovery ads remarketing</p>
                            <p><strong>Results:</strong>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>2.5x ROAS on ad spend</li>
                                    <li>300+ enrollments in first month</li>
                                    <li>40% lower CPA vs Facebook ads</li>
                                </ul>
                            </p>
                            <div class="alert alert-light small"> Key learning: Discovery ads outperformed in-stream for direct response</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card">
                        <div class="card-header bg-dark text-white">Case Study 4: Small E-commerce Store</div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p><strong>Challenge:</strong> Increase sales for handmade jewelry</p>
                            <p><strong>Solution:</strong> 15-second product showcase video + remarketing</p>
                            <p><strong>Results:</strong>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>1200% ROAS on remarketing campaign</li>
                                    <li>45% reduction in cart abandonment</li>
                                    <li>500% increase in YouTube channel subscribers</li>
                                </ul>
                            </p>
                            <div class="alert alert-light small"> Key takeaway: Remarketing to video viewers converted 3x higher than cold traffic</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 16: QUICK START CHECKLIST ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> YouTube Advertising Quick Start Checklist</h3>
            
            <div class="card bg-light mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <strong> Pre-Launch Checklist:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-0">
                                <li>□ Create a YouTube channel (required for video uploads)</li>
                                <li>□ Upload video(s) as unlisted or public</li>
                                <li>□ Set up conversion tracking (Google Ads tag + YouTube)</li>
                                <li>□ Define campaign goal (views vs clicks vs conversions)</li>
                                <li>□ Prepare UTM tracking parameters</li>
                                <li>□ Create remarketing lists (website visitors)</li>
                                <li>□ Set up YouTube channel remarketing</li>
                                <li>□ Prepare companion banner images (optional)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <strong> Video Checklist:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-0">
                                <li>□ Hook in first 5 seconds (non-negotiable!)</li>
                                <li>□ Include branding early (first 3 seconds)</li>
                                <li>□ Clear CTA (end screen or card)</li>
                                <li>□ Add captions/subtitles (85% watch without sound)</li>
                                <li>□ Optimize for mobile (large text, clear visuals)</li>
                                <li>□ Test thumbnail image (for discovery ads)</li>
                                <li>□ Keep file size under 100MB</li>
                                <li>□ 1920x1080 resolution minimum</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row mt-3">
                        <div class="col-md-12">
                            <strong> Campaign Setup Checklist:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-0">
                                <li>□ Start with skippable in-stream (lowest risk)</li>
                                <li>□ Set CPV bid $0.01-0.03 (test and adjust)</li>
                                <li>□ Use frequency cap (3-5 impressions/week)</li>
                                <li>□ Enable view-through conversions (30-day window)</li>
                                <li>□ Start with $20-50 daily budget</li>
                                <li>□ Create both prospecting + remarketing campaigns</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 17: SUMMARY ==================== -->
            <div class="alert alert-success mt-4">
                <h3 class="fw-bold"> Himanshu Shekhar's YouTube Advertising Summary</h3>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <strong> Key Stats:</strong>
                        <ul class="small mb-0">
                            <li>2.5B+ monthly active users</li>
                            <li>1B+ hours watched daily</li>
                            <li>$0.01-0.03 average CPV</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <strong> Best Formats by Goal:</strong>
                        <ul class="small mb-0">
                            <li>Awareness → Skippable In-Stream</li>
                            <li>Traffic → Discovery Ads</li>
                            <li>Conversions → Remarketing</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <strong> Critical Success Factors:</strong>
                        <ul class="small mb-0">
                            <li>Hook in first 5 seconds</li>
