            <div class="alert alert-warning mt-2">
                <strong> Himanshu's Final Word:</strong> YouTube viewers can skip ads after 5 seconds. If your ad doesn't capture attention immediately, you're wasting money. Invest 80% of your creative energy into perfecting the first 5 seconds of your video ads. The remaining 20% of the video only matters if viewers stay past 5 seconds!
            </div>

