                                <li><strong>Length:</strong> Up to 60 seconds (<strong>15-30 seconds optimal</strong>)</li>
                                <li><strong>Skippable:</strong> Yes, after 5 seconds</li>
                                <li><strong>Sound:</strong> Optional but highly recommended (design for mute-first viewing)</li>
                                <li><strong>File Size:</strong> Max 200MB</li>
                                <li><strong>CTAs:</strong> "Swipe up", "Tap to watch", "Link in description", "Watch next"</li>
                            </ul>
