                            <p><strong>Bidding & Payment:</strong></p>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Model:</strong> CPV (same as skippable in-stream)</li>
                                <li><strong>Benchmark CPV (US, 2025):</strong> $0.005 - $0.02 (<strong class="text-success">much lower than in-stream!</strong>)</li>
                                <li><strong>Recommended Starting Bid:</strong> $0.01 - $0.02 CPV</li>
                            </ul>
                            <div class="table-responsive">
    <table class="table table-bordered table-hover align-middle">
