                <td>Retail & E-commerce (Product Highlights)</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
                            <hr>
                            <p><strong>Performance Benchmarks (Good / Great):</strong></p>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>View Rate (VTR - 30s):</strong> 15-25% / 30-40%</li>
                                <li><strong>Conversion Rate (App Installs):</strong> 8-12% / 15-20%</li>
                                <li><strong>Swipe-Up Rate (CTA):</strong> 1-3% / 5-8%</li>
                                <li><strong>Average View Duration:</strong> 12-18 seconds</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="alert alert-success mb-4">
                <strong> Himanshu's Shorts Ad Creative Rules (The 1-2-3 Formula):</strong>
                <ul class="mb-0">
                    <li><strong>First 1-2 seconds (The Hook):</strong> Visual hook + on-screen text (85% watch without sound). <em>Example: "Stop scrolling!" or "Wait for it..."</em></li>
                    <li><strong>Fast pacing:</strong> Cut every <strong>2-3 seconds</strong>. Maintain high energy. Long static shots kill retention.</li>
                    <li><strong>On-screen text:</strong> Large, bold, centered (safe zone = middle 70% of frame). Min font size 24pt.</li>
                    <li><strong>Ending CTA (last 2-3 seconds):</strong> Must be visible for ≥2 seconds. Use "Swipe up", "Tap to watch", or "Link in bio".</li>
                    <li><strong>Audio strategy:</strong> Add trending sounds or original music – 70% of Shorts have sound enabled.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

