                            <pre class="bg-dark text-white p-2 small rounded">Target: In-Market "Running Shoes"
Exclude:
- Users who already purchased
- Affinity "Budget Shoppers"
- Keywords "free", "cheap"</pre>
                            <p><strong>Result:</strong> Focus budget on high-intent users while avoiding waste.</p>
                            <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Preventing wasted spend on low-quality traffic</p>
