                            <ul class="small mb-0">
                                <li>□ Hook in first 5 seconds (3 seconds for Shorts)</li>
                                <li>□ Logo shown within first 3 seconds</li>
                                <li>□ One clear problem and solution</li>
                                <li>□ Clear CTA with urgency</li>
                                <li>□ End screen added (for skippable)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <strong> Production Quality:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-0">
                                <li>□ Resolution: 1920x1080 minimum</li>
                                <li>□ Correct aspect ratio (16:9 or 9:16)</li>
                                <li>□ Good lighting (3-point recommended)</li>
                                <li>□ Clean audio (no echoes, background noise)</li>
                                <li>□ Burned-in captions added</li>
                                <li>□ File size under 200MB (ideally under 100MB)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <strong> Testing & Optimization:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-0">
                                <li>□ 3-5 creative variations created</li>
                                <li>□ A/B test set up (Rotate indefinitely)</li>
                                <li>□ Companion banner created (300x250)</li>
                                <li>□ Thumbnail created (for discovery ads)</li>
                                <li>□ UTM tracking parameters added</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 13: REAL-WORLD EXAMPLE SCRIPTS ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Real-World Example Scripts by Industry</h3>
            
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
