                            <p><strong>10-30s (Value):</strong> "Learn SEO, Google Ads, Social Media, Email Marketing from industry experts with 10+ years experience."</p>
                            <p><strong>30-50s (Proof):</strong> "10,000+ successful graduates. 92% placement rate. Watch testimonials."</p>
                            <p><strong>50-60s (CTA):</strong> "Enroll today. Limited seats. Link below for free consultation."</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 14: SUMMARY ==================== -->
            <div class="alert alert-success mt-4">
                <h3 class="fw-bold"> Himanshu Shekhar's Video Ad Creative Summary</h3>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <strong> The Non-Negotiables:</strong>
                        <ul class="small mb-0">
                            <li><strong>Hook in first 5 seconds</strong> (1-2 seconds for Shorts)</li>
                            <li><strong>Captions on every video</strong> (burned-in, not auto-captions)</li>
                            <li><strong>One clear message per video</strong> (one problem, one solution, one CTA)</li>
                            <li><strong>Logo within first 3 seconds</strong> (brand recall)</li>
                            <li><strong>End screen with CTA</strong> (for skippable in-stream)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <strong> Creative Success Formula:</strong>
                        <pre class="bg-dark text-white p-2 small rounded mt-2">Great Video Ad = 
  (Hook in 5s) 
  + (Captions) 
  + (Clear Value) 
  + (Urgent CTA) 
  + (A/B Testing)

Stop scrolling → 
  Earn attention → 
    Deliver value → 
      Drive action</pre>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="alert alert-primary mt-2">
                <strong> Himanshu's Final Word:</strong> Your creative is the single most important factor in video ad success. Better creative beats better targeting. Better creative beats bigger budgets. Invest 80% of your energy into the first 5 seconds. Test constantly. Never stop iterating. The best-performing ads today won't work in 3 months – audiences get tired. Stay curious, stay testing.
