                         <!-- ========== 18 REMARKETING DISPLAY & VIDEO CAMPAIGNS (AUTHORITY DEEP DIVE) ========== -->
<div class="section" id="topic-18">
    <div class="card mb-4 border">
        <div class="card-header bg-white py-3">
            <h2 class="mb-0">18 Remarketing Display & Video Campaigns</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body p-4">

            <div class="alert alert-light border mb-4">
                <strong> Convert past visitors into customers.</strong> Remarketing (or retargeting) shows ads to users who have already interacted with your brand – on your website, app, or YouTube channel. It typically yields <strong>2-5x higher conversion rates</strong> than prospecting and is the most profitable advertising strategy for most businesses.
            </div>

            <p>Remarketing is not just an add-on strategy – it's often the <strong>highest ROI campaign</strong> in your Google Ads account. While prospecting brings new users into your funnel, remarketing brings them back to complete their journey. Most website visitors (98-99%) leave without converting. Remarketing gives you a second chance.</p>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 1: WHY REMARKETING WORKS ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Why Remarketing Works: The Statistics</h3>
            
            <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card bg-primary text-white text-center h-100">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="display-4">2-5x</div>
                            <p class="mb-0">Higher conversion rate vs prospecting</p>
                            <small>Remarketing converts warm audiences</small>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card bg-success text-white text-center h-100">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div class="display-4">98-99%</div>
                            <p class="mb-0">First-time visitors leave without converting</p>
                            <small>Remarketing captures lost opportunities</small>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3">
                    <div class="card bg-warning text-dark text-center h-100">
