            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 3: STEP-BY-STEP SETUP GUIDE ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Step-by-Step: Setting Up Remarketing Lists</h3>
            
            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h4> Step 1: Install Tracking Tags</h4>
                    <ol>
                        <li><strong>Google Ads Remarketing Tag:</strong> Go to Tools → Audience Manager → Your data segments → Set up tag. Add to website header.</li>
                        <li><strong>Google Analytics 4 (Recommended):</strong> Link GA4 to Google Ads. Enable "Enable Google signals" for cross-device remarketing.</li>
                        <li><strong>Google Tag Manager (Best Practice):</strong> Use GTM to manage all tags in one place.</li>
                    </ol>
                    
                    <h4 class="mt-3"> Step 2: Create Website Remarketing Lists</h4>
                    <ol start="4">
                        <li>Go to <strong>Tools → Audience Manager → Your data segments</strong></li>
                        <li>Click <strong>"+"</strong> → <strong>"Website visitors"</strong></li>
                        <li>Define rules:
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>All visitors:</strong> Visitors of any page (duration: 30-540 days)</li>
                                <li><strong>Specific URL:</strong> Page URL contains "/product", "/checkout", "/thank-you"</li>
                                <li><strong>Event-based:</strong> Custom events (add_to_cart, begin_checkout, purchase)</li>
                                <li><strong>Combination rules:</strong> AND/OR logic for multiple conditions</li>
                            </ul>
                        </li>
                        <li>Set <strong>membership duration</strong> (see table above for recommendations)</li>
                        <li>Name list clearly: <code>List Type - Duration - Date Created</code> (e.g., "Cart Abandoners - 14 Days - Jan2025")</li>
                    </ol>
                    
                    <h4 class="mt-3"> Step 3: Create YouTube Remarketing Lists</h4>
                    <ol start="8">
                        <li>In Audience Manager, click <strong>"+"</strong> → <strong>"YouTube users"</strong></li>
                        <li>Choose source:
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Users who watched any video from your channel</strong></li>
                                <li><strong>Users who watched specific videos</strong></li>
                                <li><strong>Users who visited your channel page</strong></li>
                                <li><strong>Users who subscribed to your channel</strong></li>
                            </ul>
                        </li>
                        <li>Set video watch percentage: 25%, 50%, 75%, or 100%</li>
                        <li>Set membership duration (30-180 days recommended)</li>
                    </ol>
                    
                    <div class="alert alert-info mt-3">
                        <strong> Pro Tip:</strong> Lists take <strong>24-48 hours</strong> to populate. Minimum size: <strong>100 users</strong> for Display campaigns, <strong>1,000 users</strong> for YouTube campaigns.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 4: REMARKETING STRATEGIES BY FUNNEL STAGE ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Remarketing Strategies by Funnel Stage (Complete Framework)</h3>
            
            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="card h-100 border-primary">
                                <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                                    <h4 class="mb-0"> Top of Funnel (Re-engagement)</h4>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <p><strong>Audiences:</strong> All website visitors (30 days), 25-50% YouTube viewers</p>
                                    <p><strong>Messaging:</strong> "Remember us? Here's what we do." / "Watch the next video in our series."</p>
                                    <p><strong>Creative:</strong> Educational, entertaining, brand-focused</p>
                                    <p><strong>Bid Strategy:</strong> Target CPV ($0.02-0.04) or Max Clicks</p>
                                    <p><strong>Frequency Cap:</strong> 3-5 impressions per week</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="card h-100 border-success">
                                <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
                                    <h4 class="mb-0"> Middle of Funnel (Consideration)</h4>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <p><strong>Audiences:</strong> Product page viewers (30 days), 75% YouTube viewers</p>
                                    <p><strong>Messaging:</strong> "Still thinking? See why others love it." / "Compare features."</p>
                                    <p><strong>Creative:</strong> Testimonials, comparison charts, demos</p>
                                    <p><strong>Bid Strategy:</strong> Target CPA or Maximize Conversions</p>
                                    <p><strong>Frequency Cap:</strong> 3-4 impressions per week</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="card h-100 border-danger">
