                                    <p><strong>Messaging:</strong> "Complete your purchase – 10% off today only." / "Limited stock remaining."</p>
                                    <p><strong>Creative:</strong> Urgency, discounts, social proof, FOMO</p>
                                    <p><strong>Bid Strategy:</strong> Target ROAS or Target CPA (higher bids)</p>
                                    <p><strong>Frequency Cap:</strong> 5-7 impressions per week (urgency)</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 5: CREATIVE MESSAGING BY AUDIENCE TYPE ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Creative Messaging Framework by Audience Type</h3>
            
            <div class="table-responsive mb-4">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-hover">
                    <thead class="table-dark">
