                        <tr>
                            <td>Bidding the same as prospecting</strong></td>
                            <td>Missing opportunity to capture high-intent users</strong></td>
                            <td>Increase bids 20-100% for remarketing audiences</strong></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No sequential messaging</strong></td>
