                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <div class="alert alert-light mb-4">
                 <strong>Note:</strong> For most small-to-medium businesses, Google's built-in content exclusions + placement exclusions are sufficient. Third-party tools are recommended for budgets >$100k/month.
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 10: PLACEMENT AUDIT CHECKLIST ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> Weekly Placement Audit Checklist</h3>
            
            <div class="card bg-light mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <strong> Daily/Weekly Tasks:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-0">
                                <li>□ Review "Placements" tab for new high-spend placements</li>
                                <li>□ Sort by Cost (highest first) – review top 20 placements</li>
                                <li>□ Sort by CTR (lowest first) – identify underperformers</li>
                                <li>□ Check for zero-conversion placements with >$50 spend</li>
                                <li>□ Review automated rules alerts</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <strong> Monthly Tasks:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-0">
                                <li>□ Full placement report export to CSV</li>
                                <li>□ Update negative keyword lists (add new irrelevant terms)</li>
                                <li>□ Review content exclusion categories (add if needed)</li>
                                <li>□ Audit exclusion lists for accidental over-exclusion</li>
                                <li>□ Check third-party brand safety reports (if applicable)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row mt-3">
                        <div class="col-md-12">
                            <strong> Quarterly Tasks:</strong>
                            <ul class="small mb-0">
                                <li>□ Full brand safety audit across all campaigns</li>
                                <li>□ Update competitor exclusion lists</li>
                                <li>□ Review YouTube channel exclusions (add new problematic channels)</li>
                                <li>□ Assess if third-party verification is needed</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 11: COMMON BRAND SAFETY MISTAKES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4"> 12 Common Brand Safety & Placement Exclusion Mistakes</h3>
            
            <div class="table-responsive mb-4">
                <table class="table table-bordered table-striped">
                    <thead class="table-dark">
                        <tr>
                            <th>Mistake</th>
                            <th>Consequence</th>
                            <th>How to Fix</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No placement reviews at all</td>
                            <td>Ads running on harmful/porn/low-quality sites</td>
                            <td>Schedule weekly 30-minute placement audit</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Excluding placements too early (first 3 days)</td>
                            <td>Missing potentially profitable placements</td>
                            <td>Wait 7-14 days for sufficient data before excluding</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Not using negative keywords</td>
                            <td>Wasted spend on irrelevant content</td>
                            <td>Build negative keyword list from search term reports</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Over-excluding content categories</td>
                            <td>Reach reduced by 50-80%, missed opportunities</td>
                            <td>Start conservative, add exclusions based on data only</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Ignoring mobile app placements</td>
                            <td>Wasted spend on low-quality apps, accidental clicks</td>
                            <td>Review app placements separately, exclude low CTR apps</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No shared exclusion lists</td>
                            <td>Repeating same exclusions across campaigns manually</td>
                            <td>Create shared library exclusion lists, apply to all campaigns</td>
                        </tr>
                        </tr>
                            <td>Not excluding parked domains</td>
                            <td>Wasted spend on dead websites</td>
                            <td>Add parked domain exclusion list (available in shared library)</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>No YouTube channel exclusions</td>
                            <td>Ads on controversial channels, brand risk</td>
                            <td>Review YouTube placement report weekly, exclude channels</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Not using "Presence" location targeting</td>
                            <td>Ads shown to users interested in location (not physically there)</td>
                            <td>Switch to "Presence" for brand safety</td>
                        </tr>
                        </tr>
                            <td>Ignoring placement reports for years</td>
                            <td>Accumulated waste spend, outdated exclusions</td>
                            <td>Schedule full audit immediately</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <!-- ==================== SECTION 12: QUICK REFERENCE CHEAT SHEET ==================== -->
