            <!-- ==================== SECTION 5: ADVANCED PROMPT TECHNIQUES ==================== -->
            <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Advanced Prompt Techniques (Pro-Level)</h3>
            
            <div class="accordion mb-4" id="advancedAccordion">
                
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="advancedOne">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#advancedCollapseOne">
                             Technique 1: Chain-of-Thought Prompting
                        </button>
                    </h4>
                    <div id="advancedCollapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#advancedAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body bg-light">
                            <pre class="bg-dark text-white p-3 rounded"><code>"Step 1: Identify the top 3 problems your audience [describe audience] faces with [topic].
Step 2: For each problem, write 3 headlines (max 35 chars) that address that problem.
Step 3: For each problem, write 2 descriptions (max 90 chars) using PAS framework.
Step 4: Add a CTA to each description.
Format your response as a table with columns: Problem, Headline, Description"</code></pre>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="advancedTwo">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#advancedCollapseTwo">
                            Technique 2: Persona-Based Prompting
                        </button>
                    </h4>
                    <div id="advancedCollapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#advancedAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body bg-light">
                            <pre class="bg-dark text-white p-3 rounded"><code>"You are a senior copywriter at [agency name] specializing in [industry] ads.
Your target audience is [persona description: age, job title, pain points, goals].
Your brand voice is [professional/funny/empathetic/authoritative/urgent].
Generate 10 headlines and 5 descriptions for a [format] ad promoting [product/service].
Headline max: 30 chars. Description max: 90 chars.
Avoid: [words/phrases you don't want]"</code></pre>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="advancedThree">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#advancedCollapseThree">
